    {
      "bbox": [
        148,
        1558,
        1800,
        1915
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Upon consultation with City Labor Commissioner Harold A. Felix and Personnel Director Joseph Schechter, I am advised that the Mayor's Executive Order No. 38 governing time spent by employee representatives on union activities is in no way intended nor is it to be construed to require department or agency heads to grant employees leave to participate in any demonstration or other mass activity.",
